reviewer: claude-opus-5-5 (self-review)
audience: Technical leads and maintainers
purpose: What does the document scaffold generate, and why does it leave the writing empty?

Records the decision that engsys docs new generates only metadata, filename and required headings, and that docs check now fails on empty required sections.
Translated from Korean to English as a frozen record; the numbered/dated filename rules, the TODO policy and the octal-arithmetic finding are preserved.
Headings mapped to Decision / Context and constraints / Rationale and alternatives / Consequences.
Korean literal kept: the pattern example `결정|채택|Decision` stays in Korean because it is the actual contract regex value.
Counts kept as in the source: sixteen ADRs created by hand, 19 assigned documents with no empty section.

